{"seq":92,"slug":"react-form-engineering","title":"前端表单工程","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering","rating":{"composite":4.26,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"前端表单工程\">前端表单工程</h1><p>表单是 Web 应用中用户与系统交换数据的核心界面。一个注册页面、一份问卷调查、一次多步结账流程——它们的共同点是：把非结构化的用户输入转化为结构化的可信数据，同时在交互过程中给出即时反馈。前端表单工程关注的正是这个转化过程中的状态管理、校验策略、无障碍体验与性能优化。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦于<strong>表单从输入到提交的完整工程实践</strong>。与同目录下的兄弟 hub 相比，边界如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../state-management-patterns/\">状态管理模式</a> 讨论应用级状态（Redux、Zustand、信号）；本 hub 只涉及表单局部状态的设计——两者在&quot;表单状态是否放全局 store&quot;这个交汇点上有互补关系。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../react-in-depth/\">React 深度实践</a> 覆盖 React 渲染机制与 Hook 原理；本 hub 假设读者已具备 Hook 基础，直接进入表单场景下的受控/非受控模式与库级方案。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../accessibility-i18n/\">无障碍与国际化</a> 提供通用的 WCAG 合规方法论；本 hub 将其收窄到表单特有的 ARIA 模式（<code>aria-invalid</code>、<code>aria-describedby</code>、错误聚焦管理）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>先读「基础原理」章节（状态管理模式 → 校验策略 → 受控与非受控），建立心智模型。</li>\n<li>再选择「库实践」章节中与项目技术栈匹配的库深入（React Hook Form 使用最广泛，Zod 是 2026 年事实标准的校验层）。</li>\n<li>按需阅读「复杂模式」章节中的具体场景（多步向导、动态表单、嵌套数组）。</li>\n<li>最后用「体验与无障碍」章节收尾，把 ARIA 合规与用户转化指标纳入交付标准。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>前置知识：</strong> React Hook 基础（<code>useState</code>、<code>useRef</code>、<code>useEffect</code>）、TypeScript 泛型、HTML 表单元素语义。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"基础原理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"form-state-management","title":"表单状态管理模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/fundamentals/form-state-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"validation-strategies","title":"校验策略与错误处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/fundamentals/validation-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"controlled-uncontrolled","title":"受控与非受控组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/fundamentals/controlled-uncontrolled"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"libraries","title":"库实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/libraries","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"react-hook-form","title":"React Hook Form 深度实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/libraries/react-hook-form"},{"seq":2,"slug":"formik-final-form","title":"Formik 与 Final Form","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/libraries/formik-final-form"},{"seq":3,"slug":"zod-schema-validation","title":"Zod 模式校验集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/libraries/zod-schema-validation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"complex-patterns","title":"复杂模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/complex-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-step-wizard","title":"多步骤向导表单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/complex-patterns/multi-step-wizard"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamic-form-builder","title":"动态表单与表单构建器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/complex-patterns/dynamic-form-builder"},{"seq":3,"slug":"nested-array-fields","title":"嵌套字段与数组表单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/complex-patterns/nested-array-fields"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"ux-accessibility","title":"体验与无障碍","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/ux-accessibility","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"form-accessibility-aria","title":"表单无障碍与 ARIA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/ux-accessibility/form-accessibility-aria"},{"seq":2,"slug":"autosave-draft-recovery","title":"自动保存与草稿恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/ux-accessibility/autosave-draft-recovery"},{"seq":3,"slug":"form-analytics-optimization","title":"表单分析与转化优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/ux-accessibility/form-analytics-optimization"}]}]}